  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Montenegro Strengthening legislative processes and inclusive policymaking</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">It will be delivered through facilitating structured cross-party dialogue on the most important legislative pieces that would fall under the ongoing electoral reform, knowledge sharing, and peer-to-peer exchanges that empower women members of parliament (MPs) individually and collectively. These interventions would be complemented by mapping the gaps and structural barriers in parliamentary policies and practices in the areas of the project&#x2019;s objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
